      "name": "Primary action",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "Browser translation of the native filled action; actual minimum size is measured by ActionButton and arranged by ButtonRow.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-primary\">安装 BetterMalodyV</button>",
